& [P01_GenericPairFramework] is pruned
  + [proposal] abstract reconciliation across arbitrary output-only evidence types
  + [reason] profile, limit, root identity, nested faults, and evidence vocabulary are specific to this subject
  + [risk_removed] hidden trait defaults and cross-subject semantic widening
  + [survivor] one subject-local module and explicit concrete types

& [P02_BareDigestOverload] is pruned
  + [proposal] compare two strings or byte arrays for convenience
  + [reason] severs complete output-only lineage and bypasses current rederivation and scope gates
  + [risk_removed] provenance laundering and unvalidated comparison
  + [survivor] exactly two complete digest carriers by value

& [P03_RawAssemblyOverload] is pruned
  + [proposal] derive and compare two assemblies inside one entry point
  + [reason] collapses digest construction authority into reconciliation and admits a lower success surface
  + [risk_removed] duplicated orchestration and ambiguous nested fault ownership
  + [survivor] prerequisite digest outputs only

& [P04_FirstDifferenceAnalysis] is pruned
  + [proposal] traverse assemblies to name the first changed member or field
  + [reason] duplicates semantic comparison logic already committed by the digest and adds diagnostic claims not required for quarantine
  + [risk_removed] field-order drift, sensitive data release, and false causal explanation
  + [survivor] Equal or Different only

& [P05_CommonScopeDigest] is pruned
