  + [reason] no consumer requires an opaque scope hash and exact structured scope is more inspectable
  + [risk_removed] new hash grammar, collision assumption, and hidden-field omission
  + [survivor] one explicit private Serialize-only common-scope record

& [P06_ReferenceInputs] is pruned
